    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo ali'mudosya Falao",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yosefu wayaga ku'kamuwi'la Falao ati', “V'av'a wanne na v'adu'gu' v'anne v'izaga ku'fuma ku' nsi' ya Kanaani, haki'mo na ng'ombe, nkolo, mbu'li na vintu' vyav'o vyose. Nav'o v'ali' ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu wasangwa wav'asogolaga v'adu'gu'ye v'atano, wav'afilaga ku'mwa Falao ki'gele v'akioleche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Falao wav'awu'zyaga, “Muli'mo gwinywe ki'?” Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga “Iswe v'akumba v'ako ku'li' v'asav'i v'a mitugo ki'ti' v'agu'ku' v'iswe i'vyo v'av'age.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'amuwi'laga Falao ati', “Iswe v'akumba v'ako kwizaga kwikala mu nsi' yeni'yi' ki'ti' v'ageni, ku'nguno nzala yi'li' ndaki muno ku' nsi' ya Kanaani, na ku'du'hu' hangi' maswa ga ku'di'mi'zya mitugo ziswe. Hohene, ku'li' kwikonga iswe v'akumba v'ako u'ku'zumi'zye kwikala ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Falao wamuwi'laga Yosefu, “So haki'mo na v'adu'gu'yo v'izaga ku' wako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nayo nsi' yose ya Misili yi'li' ha mbele yako. Ku'nguno yeni'yo u'v'aleke v'ikale ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni, ku'nguno lu'li' lwandi' lu'soga ku'ki'la nsi' yose ya Misili. Hangi' u'lu' u'v'amanyile v'antu' v'akowozi mugati' na v'enav'a, u'v'atu'u'le v'av'e v'i'mi'li'zi v'a mitugo zyanne.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yosefu wamuletaga ise Yakobo mugati', wamutu'u'laga ha mbele yamwa Falao, nawe Yakobo wamudosyaga Falao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Falao wamuwu'zyaga Yakobo ati', “U'li' na musimo gwa myaka zinga?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ni'na musimo gwa myaka igana li'mo na maku'mi adatu'. Myaka zya wikalo wanne ki'ti' muv'i'tayi'la zili' midoo na zya lu'duko, nazyo zikagelani'la wingi wa myaka zya wikalo wa v'agu'ku' v'anne.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Yakobo wamudosyaga Falao hangi', nawe wawu'kaga henanho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yosefu wav'apaga lwandi' lwa kwikala, ise haki'mo na v'adu'gu'ye, mu nsi' ya Misili ku' lwandi' lwa Gosheni, ku' lina li'ngi' Lamesesi, u'lo lu'soga ku'ki'la nsi' yose. Hav'aga ha wikalo wav'o, ki'ti' Falao i'vyo wayombaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Yosefu wamupaga ise, v'adu'gu'ye na v'antu' v'av'o v'ose viliwa vya ku'gelani'la wingi wa v'antu' na v'ana v'av'o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wi'mi'li'zi wamwa Yosefu ha itungo lya nzala",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyav'i'taga itungo viliwa vyalekaga kwigela mu nsi' yose ya Misili na Kanaani. Nzala yav'aga ndaki muno na yalengaga v'antu' v'av'o ku'tuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu wakumingaga hela zyose zya nsi' ya Kanaani na Misili i'zyo ndi' v'agu'li'lile viliwa. Nawe wazifilaga ku' iku'lu' lyamwa Falao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yav'aga aho zyamalaga hela zya v'antu' v'a Misili na Kanaani, V'amisili v'ose v'izaga ku'mwa Yosefu na ku'muwi'la, “Hela ziswe zyamalaga. Ku'page ki'liwa! Ku' ki' ku'fwe ha mbele ya minso gako?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu wasu'v'yaga ati', “U'lu' hela zinywe zyamalaga, mundetele mitugo zinywe, nanne nku'mupa ki'liwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho v'antu' v'enav'o v'amuletelaga Yosefu mitugo zyav'o, nazyo zyav'age falasi, ng'ombe, nkolo, mbu'li na mpunda. Hohene Yosefu wav'apaga ki'liwa ku' mwaka gwenu'go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' mwaka u'go ndi' gwalonda v'izaga na ku'muwi'la ati', “Gu'ku', yi'li' nhana hela ziswe zyose zyamalile, na mitugo ziswe zyav'aga zyako. Gi'si' ku'du'hu' ninga ki'mo i'cho ku'kowolile ku'ku'pa hamo miv'i'li' ziswe na migu'nda ziswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' ki' ku'fwe ha mbele ya minso gako, na migu'nda ziswe ziv'ipe? U'ku'gu'le iswe haki'mo na migu'nda ziswe, ki'gele ku'pandi'ke ki'liwa. Iswe ku'ku'v'a v'asese v'amwa Falao, na migu'nda ziswe ziku'v'a zyakwe. Hangi' u'ku'pe mbiyu' zya ku'hamba, ku'du' kwize ku'fwe na nzala na migu'nda ziswe zisigale zili' wu'du'hu' ki'ntu'.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Yosefu wamugu'li'laga Falao migu'nda zyose zya mu Misili. V'amisili v'ose v'agu'zyaga migu'nda zyav'o, ku'nguno ya nzala yav'age ndaki muno. Ku'nguno yeni'yo nsi' yose ya Misili yav'aga yamwa Falao, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawe Yosefu wav'av'ezyaga v'antu' v'ose ku'v'a v'asese, ku'fuma lwandi' lu'mo mpaka lwandi' lu'ngi' lwa nsi' ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Yosefu akagu'lile migu'nda zya v'ahozya, ku'nguno v'eni'ki'li' v'av'age v'ali'gawu'lwa lwandi' lwav'o ku'fuma ku'mwa Falao, nav'o v'av'age na viliwa vya ku'v'agelani'la ku'nguno ya wu'gawu'lwa u'wo wav'apage Falao. Yeni'yo hu' nguno ya ku'leka ku'gu'zya migu'nda zyav'o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu wav'awi'laga v'antu' ati', “Lolagi, namugu'laga walelo inywe haki'mo na nsi' yinywe, na inywe mwav'aga nsawo yamwa Falao. Gi'si' mbiyu' i'zi mukav'i'v'e mu migu'nda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi ha itungo lya lyi'mbu'la u'lu' lyafika, ifungu li'mo mugati' na atano mulamupe Falao. Mafungu ane ago galasigali'le galav'e ga mbiyu' na ki'liwa chinywe, v'ana v'inywe, na migana zinywe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nav'o v'ayombaga “Gu'ku' waku'pi'zyaga! Ku'nguno kwapandi'kaga wu'soga ha mbele yako, niswe ku'ku'v'a v'asese v'amwa Falao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
