            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itungo lyakwe lya ku'fwa aho lyegelaga, Yakobo wamwitanaga mwane Yosefu na ku'muwi'la, “U'lu' nhana u'ntogilwe, tu'u'la mukono gwako mu matango ganne u'ndahi'li'le ati', u'kasye u'nzyi'ki'le henanha ha nsi' ya Misili. Nu'kwikonga wize u'mbezezye igambo lyeni'li' ku' chelu' na nhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi aho ndav'e nalala na v'agu'ku' v'anne, wize u'nsole u'nsinie mu nsi' ya Misili, na u'kanzyi'kile ku' viv'i'mbi' vyav'o.” Yosefu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Ndav'ezye ki'ti' i'vyo wayombaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
