              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo wamuwi'laga “Ndahi'li'le!” Yosefu wamulahi'li'laga. Haho Yakobo wakundamyaga mutwe gwakwe ku' nsagamutwe ya wu'li'li' wakwe.",
